WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:16.840
House of the Dragon is a Game of Thrones prequel
show that is confirmed by HBO’s president

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:21.740
to air in 2022.
It is based on George RR Martin’s book Fire

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:26.200
And Blood volume 1 and on Martin’s yet unfinished
Fire And Blood volume 2 book.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:30.600
“Fire &amp; Blood begins their tale with the
legendary Aegon the Conqueror, creator of

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:35.250
the Iron Throne, and goes on to recount the
generations of Targaryens who fought to hold

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:40.390
that iconic seat, all the way up to the civil
war that nearly tore their dynasty apart.”

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:45.540
That's Fire And Blood volume 1. The yet unreleased
Fire And Blood volume 2 will continue from

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:51.829
where part 1 ended, with Rhaenyra Targaryen's
son Aegon lll's reign and will cover Blackyre

00:00:51.829 --> 00:00:56.559
rebellions, war with Dorne and go all the
way to the Mad King and Robert's Rebellion

00:00:56.559 --> 00:01:00.840
that ended Targaryen dynasty.
Robert's Rebellion, also known as the War

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:06.110
of the Usurper, was a rebellion against House
Targaryen, primarily instigated by Eddard

00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:10.540
Stark, Jon Arryn, and Robert Baratheon, for
whom it's named.

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:15.060
It lasted "close to a year" and resulted in
the end of the Targaryen dynasty in the Seven

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:18.410
Kingdoms.
Miguel Sapochnik and Ryan Condal will serve

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:23.610
as showrunners and executive producers. George
R. R. Martin will also serve as executive

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:26.259
producer.
One of the main characters from this time

00:01:26.259 --> 00:01:30.340
period was Rhaegar Targaryen.
Prince Rhaegar Targaryen, the last Prince

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:33.510
of Dragonstone,
was the eldest son and heir to King Aerys

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:37.650
II Targaryen,
the Mad King by his sister-wife Queen Rhaella

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:41.600
Targaryen.
Having features of old Valyrian, Rhaegar had

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:47.250
deep purple eyes and silver-blond hair.
As a child he read obsessively, to the point

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:52.640
that jests were made about his habits.
He became a noted warrior later in life, although

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:58.220
he did not initially seem inclined to martial
habits. However, apparently by something he

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:02.090
had read, Rhaegar became motivated to become
a warrior.

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:06.060
Rhaegar was the older brother of Viserys and
Daenerys Targaryen

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:11.440
and husband of Elia Martell, with whom he
had two children, Rhaenys and Aegon.

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:15.790
He also fathered Jon Snow with Lyanna Stark,
whom he secretly married

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:21.540
following an annulment from Elia.
Aerys II's reign began with great promise,

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:26.519
but as years passed, he slid deeper and deeper
into insanity and paranoia. The shift was

00:02:26.519 --> 00:02:31.069
gradual and he frequently recovered: by the
time it became severe,

00:02:31.069 --> 00:02:36.040
Prince Rhaegar already showed such great promise
as the future heir to the throne that most

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:41.630
were willing to endure Aerys's eccentricities,
intending to wait out the remainder of his

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:47.000
reign until Rhaegar succeeded him.
Rhaegar was brave, kind, and wise and most

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:51.510
looked forward to the golden era that would
assuredly begin when he would ascend to the

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:55.220
throne. Greatly troubled by Aerys II's growing
insanity,

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:58.969
Rhaegar was torn between whether to act against
him or not,

00:02:58.969 --> 00:03:02.040
but could not bring himself to turn against
his own father.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:07.760
At court, there was growing tension between
factions loyal to the king and to the prince.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:11.040
Grand Maester Pycelle dispatched a letter
to the Citadel,

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:15.730
writing that tensions and division at court
strongly resembled those before the Dance

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:19.159
of the Dragons.
Pycelle was fearful a Targaryen civil war

00:03:19.159 --> 00:03:22.300
would break out
unless some accord could be reached that would

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:26.120
satisfy both factions.
Like the rest of the realm, Rhaegar hoped

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:29.420
to simply wait out the rest of his father's
reign,

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:33.120
and that his bouts of insanity would remain
manageable by his courtiers.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:38.030
Rhaegar had good reason to think that the
small council could keep the realm together

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:43.099
despite his father's madness, as it was very
capably led by Tywin Lannister,

00:03:43.099 --> 00:03:48.510
who served as Aerys's Hand for nearly twenty
years. Tywin was not only able to keep Aerys

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:53.389
from tearing the realm apart, but managed
royal affairs so well, that he brought two

00:03:53.389 --> 00:03:57.630
decades of peace and plenty for Westeros,
to the point that most people throughout the

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:02.400
realm were unaware of the king's madness until
the final years of his reign.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:07.340
Many assumed that in reward for Tywin's long
and distinguished service as Aerys's chief

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:10.319
advisor,
the bond between the Targaryens and Lannisters

00:04:10.319 --> 00:04:15.189
would eventually be solidified with a marriage-alliance
between Prince Rhaegar and Tywin's daughter

00:04:15.189 --> 00:04:18.799
Cersei. Yet Aerys surprisingly spurned the
match,

00:04:18.799 --> 00:04:23.250
saying that Tywin was still just a servant
and should not try to elevate his family above

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:26.970
its station,
as such a match was beneath Rhaegar.

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:31.220
Aerys instead agreed to an arranged marriage
between Rhaegar and Elia Martell,

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:34.569
a princess from Dorne, daughter of the ruling
Princess of Dorne

00:04:34.569 --> 00:04:38.979
(who was a distant cousin of the royal line
through intermarriage a century before).

00:04:38.979 --> 00:04:42.650
Rhaegar and Elia's marriage was happy according
to all accounts.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:48.050
Rhaegar and Elia had two children: a daughter
named Rhaenys, and then a son named Aegon.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:52.140
Maester Aemon, whom Rhaegar corresponded via
raven messages,

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:56.099
remembers that Rhaegar believed his child
Aegon to be the prince that was promised.

00:04:56.099 --> 00:05:01.800
A few years later, the Great Tourney at Harrenhal
was held and all the prominent lords of Westeros

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:06.650
assembled. During the feast, Rhaegar played
a song on his harp so beautiful and sorrowful

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:11.990
that it moved even the wild she-wolf Lyanna
Stark to tears. The exact events that happened

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:16.770
in private are unknown, but the public events
at the tourney's final joust are known to

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:21.030
all: Rhaegar won.
During the great tourney at Harrenhal, Rhaegar

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:25.180
seemed unstoppable
and defeated even Ser Arthur Dayne. Taking

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:28.000
the winter rose crown for the queen of love
and beauty,

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:33.470
he revealed his interest in Lyanna Stark by
passing over his wife, Princess Elia of Dorne,

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:38.050
and setting it in Lyanna's lap. Eddard Stark
later recalled that moment as "when all the

00:05:38.050 --> 00:05:41.669
smiles died".
The next year, Rhaegar seemingly kidnapped

00:05:41.669 --> 00:05:46.590
Lyanna, for reasons unknown.
This act ultimately triggered Robert's Rebellion

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:51.430
and the downfall of the Targaryen dynasty.
Unknown to all, Lyanna had actually desired

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:56.360
to leave with Rhaegar, and they ran off together
to the Red Mountains of Dorne. They stayed

00:05:56.360 --> 00:06:00.009
at a relatively small castle Rhaegar named
the Tower of Joy.

00:06:00.009 --> 00:06:04.680
Rhaegar arranged for the High Septon to grant
him an annulment from his marriage to Elia

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:07.770
Martell,
then personally officiate his secret marriage

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:11.849
to Lyanna the same day.
Lyanna's eldest brother Brandon then rode

00:06:11.849 --> 00:06:15.340
to King's Landing
to demand the return of his sister and the

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:19.190
death of Rhaegar.
King Aerys imprisoned him, and when Rickard

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:23.889
Stark went south to ransom his son,
he was imprisoned as well. The Mad King then

00:06:23.889 --> 00:06:29.020
brutally executed both of them
by burning Lord Rickard alive with wildfire

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:32.800
in front of the Iron Throne
and baiting Brandon into strangling himself

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:38.710
to death in an effort to save his father.
Afterward, King Aerys demanded Jon Arryn to

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:42.190
send him the heads of Eddard Stark and Robert
Baratheon.

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:46.320
Jon Arryn refused, and instead, raised his
banners in revolt.

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:51.170
Eddard Stark and Lyanna's betrothed, Robert
Baratheon, joined him to overthrow the Targaryen

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:56.830
dynasty. This war became known as Robert's
Rebellion, or the "War of the Usurper" to

00:06:56.830 --> 00:07:01.879
Targaryen loyalists. To the confusion of many,
Rhaegar's location remained unknown during

00:07:01.879 --> 00:07:07.150
most of the war, which lasted about a year:
as Robert Baratheon's rebel army fought its

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:10.710
way up from Storm's End
through the Reach and the Riverlands, and

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:14.539
then up to the Trident, Rhaegar was nowhere
to be seen.

00:07:14.539 --> 00:07:19.740
Rhaegar then suddenly returned to the royal
court at King's Landing to lead the crown's

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:22.750
armies.
Both sides now mobilized the full might of

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:28.990
their forces: Robert led his rebel army south
(composed of Baratheon, Stark, Tully, and

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:34.970
Arryn forces) while Rhaegar led the royal
army north to meet him (composed of the Targaryen

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:41.120
armies raised from the Crownlands, supplemented
by another 10,000 from Dorne). Rhaegar owned

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:46.520
night-black plate armor, with the three-headed
dragon of House Targaryen decorated in rubies

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:50.830
on its breastplate, and underneath the plate
he wore golden ringmail.

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:57.039
Rhaegar decorated his helm with gold, orange,
and red silken streamers resembling flames.

00:07:57.039 --> 00:08:02.199
Accompanying Rhaegar were two of the Kingsguard,
Barristan Selmy and Lewyn Martell (uncle of

00:08:02.199 --> 00:08:08.659
Rhaegar's wife Elia). On the way, Rhaegar
privately confided to Barristan that after

00:08:08.659 --> 00:08:10.330
they won,
there would be "many changes" at the royal

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:17.189
court upon his return - alluding that he intended
to depose his father for his crimes and instability,

00:08:17.189 --> 00:08:20.140
and try to restore peace with the Great Houses
of the realm.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:24.960
Rhaegar and Robert's forces finally clashed
at the climactic Battle of the Trident,

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:30.240
at the crossing of the Kingsroad over the
river (not far from the Inn at the Crossroads).

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:35.349
Rhaegar's army was fresh and slightly larger,
but Robert's was more battle-hardened,

00:08:35.349 --> 00:08:39.370
and they slowly gained ground.
Rhaegar and Robert spotted each other across

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:44.490
the battlefield and rode out to fight,
resulting in a legendary duel as the battle

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:48.880
dragged on around them.
Rhaegar, despite wounding Robert, was struck

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:54.190
down with a massive blow from Robert's warhammer,
which scattered the rubies encrusted in Rhaegar's

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:58.510
armor into the water.
With their leader killed, the Targaryen army

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:03.760
collapsed, and the rebels were victorious.
With Rhaegar's death, the Targaryen cause

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:08.961
was doomed: most of their supporters had been
fighting for Rhaegar, not the Mad King, so

00:09:08.961 --> 00:09:12.590
after he died most either surrendered or switched
sides.

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:16.930
Soon after Rhaegar's death, most of his family
followed to an early grave.

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:21.480
The first was his first wife Elia and their
children when they were brutally killed by

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:24.580
Ser Gregor Clegane during the Sack of King's
Landing.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:29.790
Meanwhile, Jaime Lannister killed Rhaegar's
father, King Aerys, to prevent the wildfire

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:33.310
plot.
Shortly before the sack, Rhaegar's heavily

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:37.940
pregnant mother Queen Rhaella had been sent
to safety on Dragonstone island, along with

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:42.320
his younger brother Viserys.
Not long after they arrived, however, Rhaella

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:47.680
died giving birth to Rhaegar's posthumous
younger sister, Daenerys Targaryen.

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:52.580
Viserys and his newborn sister then fled into
exile in the Free Cities, across the Narrow

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:55.810
Sea,
before Robert's soldiers could arrive on the

00:09:55.810 --> 00:10:00.850
island. Lyanna Stark did not survive much
longer than Rhaegar either: she died from

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:06.840
childbirth, after having given birth to her
son,Rhaegar's last child and heir. With her

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:10.100
last breath, Lyanna told Eddard of her secret
marriage to Rhaegar,

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:16.040
and that their son's name was "Aegon Targaryen".
Ultimately, Rhaegar still remains a controversial

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:20.630
figure as his star-crossed romance with Lyanna
Stark inadvertently led

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:24.900
to his insane father sparking a war with half
of the Seven Kingdoms.

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:28.790
Thousands died due to Rhaegar's actions (or
inaction),

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:32.890
ending in his death, the overthrow and exile
of what was left of his family,

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:38.440
and (indirectly) resulted in the murder of
Elia and their two children together.

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:42.830
What could have possibly motivated Rhaegar
to not only elope with Lyanna,

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:46.780
but fight a war to keep their marriage a secret,
remains unknown.

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:50.760
Rhaegar valued his forthcoming child with
Lyanna so much

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:55.390
that he even left champions of his Kingsguard
behind in Dorne to defend her –

00:10:55.390 --> 00:11:00.220
living legends who could have tipped the balance
if they had fought by his side at the Battle

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:05.670
of the Trident. Perhaps it was his obsession
with Azor Ahai prophecy, believing his son

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:10.590
Aegon, who we know as Jon Snow, was the Prince
that was Promised. There's so much we need

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:13.950
to learn.
How did Rhaegar and Lyanna fall in love and

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:18.900
why did they decide to run away.
What was that important to them to leave without

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:23.080
an explanation, making it seem like he kidnapped
her which put the Seven Kingdoms into the

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:28.110
state of chaos which started the rebellion
that ended the Targaryen dynasty. But that's

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:31.340
all we have for now, questions without certain
answers,

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:35.110
questions which the Game of Thrones prequel
about history of House Targaryen,

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:38.260
House of the Dragon, will answer.
Thank you so much for watching, I hope you

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:41.094
enjoyed this video and if you did please give
it a big thumbs up and I hope to see you in

00:11:41.094 --> 00:11:41.680
the next one.
Peace!

